  "description": "Roslyn analyzers that flag non-deterministic API usage (DateTime.Now, Guid.NewGuid, ...) inside durable workflow bodies, which would break deterministic replay. Suggests the deterministic IWorkflowContext primitives instead. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
